  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Lumen.Runtime::Lumen.Level.LoreInscription
  title: "Bek\xE7inin Yemini"
  text: "Ta\u015F\xE7\u0131 Arven son kap\u0131n\u0131n \xF6n\xFCnde yemin etti: \"I\u015F\u0131k geri d\xF6nmeden kimse ge\xE7meyecek.\" Y\u0131llar ge\xE7ti, Arven ta\u015Fa d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFC ama yemini bozulmad\u0131. O h\xE2l\xE2 bekliyor ve konu\u015Fan\u0131 dinliyor."
